Package: Atlas
Title: Automated Model Building with LLM Agents
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matt", "O'Reilly", email = "fermoymatt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds statistical and machine learning models in R by driving an
    agentic LLM loop ('ellmer'). The agent explores your data, proposes a plan
    for your approval, fits and evaluates candidate models, and returns the
    fitted models with a leaderboard and a report of how each was built. All
    state is checkpointed to disk, so sessions are persistent and resumable.
